@LeverageCoach First off, want to reiterate my gratitude for taking the time to respond and help. I really appreciate it. 
1. I am already doing a listening tour with the team itself. It's very clear to me that the team incl leadership is very tactical and reactive. They have had hypergrowth in the last couple of years and are really just forming their teams and sub teams and haven't had an opportunity to think through what their overall mission, vision is. They have no documentation and are unable to articulate whatsoever about what their team structure is , what areas they work on etc. It's one thing to help them organize/bring structure but am struggling with their inability to even write down what they do/planning to do.  
2. Also could you elaborate on the approach with partner teams ? I hadn't thought about that so that would be interesting.
